DATE 2
Location: Mess Hall

PC chooses Garp date option.

:: Introduction

{$name}: Ugh, I’m starving. It wouldn’t be a bad idea to grab some food before I go look for Garp…

set_background(“mess hall”, Show)

{$name}: Finally here. Mmm, something smells good! I should hop in line…

{$name}: I think I’ll grab this, a little of that, maybe some of this… Alright, perfect. Now, where should…

{$name}: Hey! Isn’t that–

{$garp}: BWAHAHAHAHA! My favorite time of day: lunch!

{$name}: (Oh, there he is! He’s sitting alone, though…)
(I’ll let him eat in peace. We can talk later.) => route_a
(I should go sit with him! I was looking for him anyway.) => route_b
(Does he always sit by himself? Maybe I should ask around…) => route_c


:: route_a
{$name}: (Alright, I’ll just take my food and–)

There’s a sudden bang.

{$garp}: Did you think I wouldn’t see you, [Name]?!

Garp suddenly appears right in front of PC. 

{$garp}: Bwahahaha, what’s with that face? Were you trying to avoid me?
Of course not! I just wasn’t sure you wanted company.
{$garp}: You see an old man sitting by himself and think he wouldn’t want company? Oh, whatever. Get over here!
=>route_d
Uh… no…? (-)
{$garp}: …I see. Well, let’s go! You’re sitting with me! 
=>route_d
No, I’m just not foolish enough to get between you and your lunch. (+)
{$garp}: Hah! I knew you had some brains. Well, I’m allowing it, so it’s fine. C’mon, sit with me!
=>route_d

:: route_b

{$name}: Hello, Gar… uh, sir! Mind if I sit with you?

{$name}: (Huh? He looks surprised for some reason…)

{$garp}: …BWAHAHAHA! Sure, [Name]! I’m a little surprised, though; not many Marines tend to sit with me.
Well, I’m not just any old Marine! (+)
{$garp}: Heh, I guess not! You’ve got guts, but that’s not a bad thing.
{$garp}: It’s been a long while since I’ve sat at the same table with anyone besides Senny, Tsuru, or my crew, so I might as well enjoy it!
=>route_d
Really? Why not?
{$garp}: …
{$garp}: Let’s just say that when you’re thought of as a hero, others think they shouldn’t approach you.
Whether it’s respect or cowardice, everyone’s got an excuse.
{$garp}: But that doesn’t seem to apply to you, does it…? Well, I don’t mind either way.
=>route_d
Oh… should I move? (-)
{$garp}: You’re already here, aren’t you?
{$garp}: Just sit and eat. No need to second-guess yourself too much.
=>route_d

:: route_c

{$name}: Hmmm… Oh! Excuse me!

Random Marine: Yes? What do you need?

{$name}: I was wondering about Instructor Garp over there. Does he always sit alone?

Random Marine: Uh, well…

Random Marine: To tell you the truth, I wouldn’t know. I see him every day, but I don’t really pay attention to stuff like that. He’s a hero, y’know? I wouldn’t want to bother him or anything. What if he caught me staring? He might make me run laps or something! 
So you’re afraid of him, then?
Random Marine: It’s not like that; he’s just… he’s like the Fleet Commander, or even the Inspector General, y’know? He’s not like us normal, mortal Marines. 
Random Marine: I dunno. I once thought that I could be like him, but now, I think it’s better to just do my job and not have delusions of heroism.
Random Marine: Anyway, I should go.
{$name}: Hmmm…
I’m going to go sit with him.
=>route_b
Maybe I’ll just grab one more plate of food…
=>route_a
I think I’m just going to go eat in Tsuru’s office instead.
=>end

- So you look up to him, then?
Random Marine: I mean, yeah… doesn’t everyone? He’s a legend—he captured the Pirate King and everything, y’know? He’s not like us normal, mortal Marines. 
Random Marine: I dunno. I once thought that I could be like him, but now, I’m satisfied just being where I am.
Random Marine: Anyway, I should go.
{$name}: Hmmm…
I’m going to go sit with him.
=>route_b
Maybe I’ll just grab one more plate of food…
=>route_a
I think I’m just going to go eat in Tsuru’s office instead.
